7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O8S6rrjScOEQ7kNvwEKa4l2&_nc_oc=Adpyk0dA2XCBehY1tJRBCGaUuf35O9hWZFQ5-ntix5gcL-b29tveDR9aSGmWX4euUUs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af02BVRpZZeQHvY2s-OhSxvFqNLBg76_iG4rk1ayIgEy9w&oe=69EE032F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageLandscape.png", "id": "1721481028535123", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_1721481031868456_1060556618134437396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WURsMjG0jQwQ7kNvwHUzPwp&_nc_oc=Adp7H6rFiTkO-19ATwfP57Mf9KgFCuXvwDV6kPYk9d8p78rX_7f9ZNrb1TmYJEOJkSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0ALf00-JATvvE-_G9i1ynyWjTpRMNgjUUJfGzyG-H7KA&oe=69EDF054"}, "display_name": "TaVRn's Takedown - Naheulbeuk", "keywords": ["fight", "fantasy", "tavern", "punch"], "long_description": "TaVRn\u2019s Takedown is a VR beat\u2019em up set in the hilariously messed-up world of Naheulbeuk\u2019s Dungeon, and developed by VR Studio LDLC.  \n\nIn TaVRn\u2019s Takedown - Naheulbeuk, your mission is to save Mliuej from a mysterious threat that\u2019s ruining the local breweries. Bring order back to corrupted taverns in immersive hand-to-hand fighting! \n \nHow? By punching, smashing and throwing anything that isn\u2019t nailed down at your enemies: goblins, humans, or anyone else stupid enough to stand in your way.  \n\nAnd you? You\u2019re just a perfectly average hero (or let\u2019s just say\u2026 an adventurer ?) trying to save the day. Or totally screw it up. Either way, it\u2019s fine.", "short_description": "TaVRn\u2019s Takedown is a VR beat \u2018em up from the world of Naheulbeuk\u2019s Dungeon, developed by VR Studio LDLC. Punch enemies, break taverns, and fight for the fate of Mliuej\u2026 or just create total mayhem!"}]}, "developer_name": "VR STUDIO LDLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ldlc-vrstudio.com/pivacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_na